<!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"hk-intro"} -->
<p class="hk-intro">Join the priority waitlist to secure advance notification when registration opens for upcoming 2027 Hakari Course cohorts.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:group {"className":"hk-read","layout":{"type":"default"}} -->
<div class="wp-block-group hk-read"><!-- wp:heading {"level":3,"className":"hk-rh"} -->
<h3 class="wp-block-heading hk-rh">Why Cohorts Are Capped at Forty Seats</h3>
<!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"hk-body"} -->
<p class="hk-body">Every Hakari Course cohort is strictly limited to 40 participants. We maintain small class sizes so lead instructor Ines Vermeulen and tutors Samuel Adeyemi and Lina Haddad can individually evaluate each learner's practical temperature log and answer specific operational questions during the live Tuesday Q&amp;A sessions. Because places fill rapidly, our waitlist ensures that shift supervisors, sous-chefs, and kitchen business owners who missed the initial enrolment window get priority access to open seats before public announcement.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {"level":3,"className":"hk-rh"} -->
<h3 class="wp-block-heading hk-rh">Upcoming Waitlist Cohort Windows</h3>
<!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"hk-body"} -->
<p class="hk-body">The waitlist currently accepts early registrations for two upcoming 2027 cohorts. Cohort 16 runs from 3 May to 13 June 2027, with the priority waitlist notification window opening on 1 February 2027. Cohort 17 runs from 6 September to 17 October 2027 and is also accepting waitlist submissions. When priority enrolment opens, waitlist members receive an email link granting 48 hours of early access to reserve their seat before general availability. Registration requires no deposit or financial obligation until you decide to enrol.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>
<!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:group {"className":"hk-formbox","layout":{"type":"default"}} -->
<div class="wp-block-group hk-formbox"><!-- wp:heading {"level":3,"className":"hk-rh"} -->
<h3 class="wp-block-heading hk-rh">Waitlist Registration Form and Information</h3>
<!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"hk-body"} -->
<p class="hk-body">To join the priority notification list, complete the simple signup form below with your full name, working email address, and your preferred cohort start date (Cohort 16 or Cohort 17). Please tick the consent checkbox allowing us to contact you regarding cohort updates. We will never share your personal details with third parties, and we send only essential enrolment notifications. Once submitted, Tomás Brandt will confirm your place on the waitlist, and you will receive your early invitation when your cohort opens.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:html -->
